---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="NiqeLab is a small studio that designs and builds websites. One craft, one team, every project.">
  <section class="wrap pad--tight">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 data-split="lines" data-intro class="h2" style="font-size: var(--t-xl);">One studio. <em>One craft.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal="up" data-intro data-delay="0.08" style="font-size:1.1rem;">
      NiqeLab designs and builds websites. That is the whole business. We do not run ad accounts,
      post to social media, or sell SEO retainers, so every project gets a team that is only
      thinking about your site.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap pad--tight">
    <div class="pair pair--3">
      <div class="panel panel--light" data-reveal="up">
        <p style="font-family: var(--f-display); font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700;">Precise</p>
        <p style="margin-top:0.6rem; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.65; color: var(--c-muted);">Short sentences, real specifics, no filler. We talk about the page, the timeline and the price.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel--light" data-reveal="up" data-delay="0.08">
        <p style="font-family: var(--f-display); font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700;">Direct</p>
        <p style="margin-top:0.6rem; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.65; color: var(--c-muted);">If a site is losing you customers, we will say so, and say exactly why.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel--light" data-reveal="up" data-delay="0.16">
        <p style="font-family: var(--f-display); font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700;">Built to last</p>
        <p style="margin-top:0.6rem; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.65; color: var(--c-muted);">A custom site holds up for years. A template gets rebuilt every twelve months.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap pad--tight" style="border-top:1px solid var(--c-line);">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 data-split="lines">Why this <em>matters.</em></h2>
      <p>
        Most people visiting your site have already decided roughly what they want. What they
        have not decided is whether to trust you with it. A slow page, an unclear next step or a
        design that looks years old answers that question before you get a chance to. A site
        built properly answers it the way you would want it answered.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta pad wrap">
    <h2 data-split="lines">Got a site that needs <em style="color: var(--c-pop);">this kind of attention?</em></h2>
    <div style="margin-top:1.6rem;">
      <a href="/niqelab/contact/" class="btn btn--solid" data-fill data-magnetic="0.2"><span class="btn__fill" aria-hidden="true"></span>Start a project</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
